{'symbol': 'AEE', 'date': '2023-06-20 09:00:00', 'title': 'AMEREN MISSOURI PLANS NEW SOLAR GENERATION CAPABLE OF POWERING MORE THAN 95,000 HOMES', 'text': "COMPANY'S LARGEST-EVER SOLAR INVESTMENT ANNOUNCEMENT INCLUDES FOUR PROJECTS SLATED TO GENERATE APPROXIMATELY 550 MEGAWATTS OF RENEWABLE ENERGY ST. LOUIS , JUNE 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY\xa0AMEREN MISSOURI, A SUBSIDIARY OF AMEREN CORPORATION (NYSE: AEE), ANNOUNCED IT INTENDS TO ACQUIRE OR BUILD APPROXIMATELY 550 MEGAWATTS (MW) OF SOLAR ENERGY, CONTINUING THE COMPANY'S INVESTMENT IN RENEWABLE GENERATION."}